    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38238" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαντλ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pump over</i> or <i>upon, pour over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				112c
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			, ib.d.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					253a
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγους τινὶ ἐ.</span>
			<i>pour a flood</i> of words <i>over,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				899.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				6.51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					107
				</span></i>
			; <i>irrigate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. καὶ ἄρδειν τὰ φυτά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.688e
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυριάδας χιλιάδας τῇ Σμύρνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					1.25.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑσμὸν ἡδονῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>VA</u>
					6.11
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				18
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be irrigated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Stud.Pal.</u>
				17p.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάμασι λόγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.345
				</span></i>
			; <i>overflowed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντίσιν ἐπηντλημένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.107a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
